1
00:00:03,049 --> 00:00:05,754
Rule: not on camera? Refuse.

2
00:00:07,804 --> 00:00:10,697
Ten skewers. Cook them until they stop talking.

3
00:00:11,247 --> 00:00:12,966
Weird. Check the camera.

4
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:16,966
On camera. Fine. Cook.

5
00:00:20,916 --> 00:00:21,628
Payment.

6
00:00:21,908 --> 00:00:22,462
...That's a leaf.

7
00:00:22,742 --> 00:00:23,769
Very valuable.

8
00:00:28,116 --> 00:00:30,852
Iced tea. Less sugar. Less... you.

9
00:00:31,516 --> 00:00:33,631
She's staring. Camera!

10
00:00:34,681 --> 00:00:36,685
Nobody. She's not on camera.

11
00:00:37,731 --> 00:00:39,908
Refuse! REFUSE!

12
00:00:41,331 --> 00:00:41,833
Closing!

13
00:00:43,531 --> 00:00:45,492
Next night. Who isn't human?
